StrandedCPU

Includes code derived from LOOM by Mehmet Kerem Turkcan and its contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/mkturkcan/Loom
Baseline: 71483281622684f32ea81c721b5a96c29cff4766
Paper: Loom: A Scalable Analytical Neural Computer Architecture
https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08816

StrandedCPU modifies the ISA, arithmetic, compiler, and attention implementation.
It adds checked C/Python execution, exact fractions, CPU and CUDA ISA backends,
answer scoring, model helpers, and native iCEstick RTL and host interfaces.

